                                "sense_id": "71b883c9-6f9d-301a-8313-df23b1e421d1",
                                "text": "At its best, psychoanalysis is the classic therapeutic technique for exploring unconscious processes. At its less-than-best, it is a jargon-opacified, oedipus-complicated, libido-theoretical, pseudo-scientific cult whose messiah is Sigmund Freud."
                            },
                            {
