                                "sense_id": "71b883c9-6f9d-301a-8313-df23b1e421d1",
                                "text": "They haven't, largely, because the debate has been deliberately opacified, with nationalist and Conservative politicians in particular still seeking to portray British Imperialism as a source of pride and Britain as the \"good guy\" in the slavery debate."
                            }
                        ]
